  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline Absolute is a six-sided co-polyester designed for players seeking a plush yet crisp response with ample spin and easy free power. Its hexagonal geometry creates mechanical ball grip for spin, while the softer and livelier response improves pocketing, comfort and effortless depth. Absolute is particularly suitable for players who want the performance characteristics of a shaped co-poly without the demanding stiffness or low-powered response of traditional firm control strings. It is available in Black at 1.20 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline Absolute 是一款采用六边形结构的共聚酯球线，核心定位是 Plush、Crisp、Spin 和 Free Power。六边形截面提供机械咬球和旋转，而更柔和、更有活力的线床响应则增加 Pocketing、舒适性以及轻松获得深度和速度的能力。相比传统偏硬、低力量的控制型聚酯，Absolute 更容易打、更有弹性，适合希望获得异形聚酯旋转性能，但又不想牺牲舒适和免费力量的中高级球员。产品规格为 1.20 毫米 / 17，颜色为 Black。"
  },

